      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the root cause. TYPEC_RP_RESERVED is an invalid/reserved TCPCI value and shouldn\u0027t be used anywhere, even here.\n\n\u003e TYPEC_CC_OPEN \u003d OPEN (with any pull).\n\u003e TYPEC_RP_RESERVED \u003d Invalid and shall not be used.\n\nSee also:\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/changes/02/2486502/4/board/servo_v4p1/usb_pd_policy.c#1372",
      "revId": "9afa625abfcfe6d7d66508ef2c64e69c3bcd63c8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
