      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T00:09:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t where we set it to RP_RESERVED, we set it when we go into CONFIG_DETACH.\n\nIts probably most correct to do CC_OPEN instead; but that is a bigger change. I\u0027ll leave it up to the Servo owners to decide if we should do a refactor as part of this.",
